@308huskyeah I’m aware, I’m just pointing out that times are definitely different brother. Honestly I’d love for rates to go up and houses to go down  and the borrowing criteria to be extremely strict. But that’s not good for profitably of the lender. 

Oh well, I’m personally making plenty of money. It’s just a matter of saving up a good down payment for myself. 

Others, I can’t say the same for.
